On Wed, Jan 18, 2023 at 05:34:51PM +0100, Ralf Hildebrandt via Openvpn-user=
s wrote:
> You might have noticed our bug reports regarding capabilities && 2.6rc2.
> The whole point of it all was to test 2.6.x's DCO in our openvpn infrastr=
ucture :)

And we appreciate this :-)

> But once we enabled DCO on the server side, things started to go awry - a=
gain.
>=20
> 2.5.x was not able to connect.=20
> So I thought: "Meh, maybe I should use 2.6rc on both cient and server".=20
> Said and done.
>=20
> Now the server complains:
> =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
